    subtypes: ["Alveolar soft part sarcoma of the deep soft tissue of the limbs (adolescents and young adults)", "Head and neck (orbit, tongue) alveolar soft part sarcoma in children", "Metastatic disease to lung, bone and brain (indolent course)"],
